# Context Crystal (.cursorrules)

When working in this repository:
- Context is persisted using `ccrystal`.
- Run `ccrystal hydrate <id>` at session startup.
- Flush milestones atomically with `ccrystal batch "node add <id> -k checkpoint -s '...'; task done <id> -t <task-id>"`.
- Support out-of-tree context stores via `CCRYSTAL_STORE`.
